# Typed sketch values create dimensions (docs/plans/production-features.md P1 §2.1): the first
# sketch of the tutorial bracket and a typed line chain end fully defined without a manual
# dimension. TYPEDDIMS on makes the run independent of the user's preference.
TYPEDDIMS on
SKETCH XY
RECT
0,0
150,100
CHECK dof 0
LINE
200,0
@60,0
@0,40
@-60,0
200,0
CHECK dof 0
FINISH
CHECK sketches == 1
CHECK status ok
